Package: libnpth
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libsystem
Description: New GNU Portable Threads library
 nPth is the thread library that GnuPG's programs use: a portable layer
 over POSIX threads that runs one thread at a time.

Package: libnpth-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libnpth (= ${binary:Version})
Description: New GNU Portable Threads library: development files
 The header, the pkg-config file and the autoconf macro for building
 programs against nPth.
